  "description": {
    "text": "ex Special Set, released on 19 May 2023: four packs each of the Snow Hazard and Clay Burst expansions and a promo pack sure to hold a Pokémon ex. The pack held one of three card sets at random, two Toedscool and Toedscruel ex, Pawmi, Pawmo and Pawmot ex, or two Greavard and Houndstone ex, the first time each of the three appeared as a Pokémon ex. This set holds the seven promo cards.",
    "sources": [
      {
